/td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td>Celestial roc<br/></td>\n<td>CG<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td>Elemental, elder (any)<br/></td>\n<td>N<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td>Devil, barbed<br/></td>\n<td>LE<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td>Fiendish dire shark<sup><b>1</b></sup><br/></td>\n<td>NE<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td>Fiendish monstrous scorpion, Gargantuan<br/></td>\n<td>NE<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td>Night hag<br/></td>\n<td>NE<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td>Bebilith (demon)<br/></td>\n<td>CE<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td>Fiendish monstrous spider, Colossal<br/></td>\n<td>CE<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td>Hezrou (demon)<br/></td>\n<td>CE<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"2\">\n<td colspan=\"2\">1 May be summoned only into an aquatic or watery environment.<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n</table><p/>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 SpellsS');
INSERT INTO spell VALUES (619,'Summon Nature\'s Ally I','summon nature\'s ally I','Conjuration','Summoning',NULL,NULL,'Druid 1, Ranger 1','V, S, DF','1 round','Close (25 ft. + 5 ft./2 levels)',NULL,NULL,'One summoned creature','1 round/level (D)','None','No','Calls animal to fight for you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'\n      <p>This spell summons a natural creature. It appears where you designate and acts immediately, on your turn. It attacks your opponents to the best of its ability. If you can communicate with the creature, you can direct it not to attack, to attack particular enemies, or to perform other actions.</p>\n      <p>A summoned monster cannot summon or otherwise conjure another creature, nor can it use any teleportation or planar travel abilities. Creatures cannot be summoned into an environment that cannot support them.</p>\n      <p>The spell conjures one of the creatures from the 1st-level list on the accompanying Summon Nature\'s Ally table. You choose which kind of creature to summon, and you can change that choice each time you cast the spell. All the creatures on the table are neutral unless otherwise noted.</p>\n      <p/>\n    ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'\n      <div topic=\"Summon Nature\'s Ally I\" level=\"5\"><p><h5>Summon Nature\'s Ally I</h5></p><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\"><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td width=\"25%\"/><td>Conjuration (Summoning)<br/></td></tr><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td width=\"25%\"><b>Level:</b><br/></td><td>Druid 1, Ranger 1<br/></td></tr><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td width=\"25%\"><b>Components:</b><br/></td><td>V, S, DF<br/></td></tr><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td width=\"25%\"><b>Casting Time:</b><br/></td><td>1 round<br/></td></tr><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td width=\"25%\"><b>Range:</b><br/></td><td>Close (25 ft. + 5 ft./2 levels)<br/></td></tr><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td width=\"25%\"><b>Effect:</b><br/></td><td>One summoned creature<br/></td></tr><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td width=\"25%\"><b>Duration:</b><br/></td><td>1 round/level (D)<br/></td></tr><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td width=\"25%\"><b>Saving Throw:</b><br/></td><td>None<br/></td></tr><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td width=\"25%\"><b>Spell Resistance:</b><br/></td><td>No<br/></td></tr></table><p>This spell summons a natural creature. It appears where you designate and acts immediately, on your turn. It attacks your opponents to the best of its ability. If you can communicate with the creature, you can direct it not to attack, to attack particular enemies, or to perform other actions.</p><p>A summoned monster cannot summon or otherwise conjure another creature, nor can it use any teleportation or planar travel abilities. Creatures cannot be summoned into an environment that cannot support them.</p><p>The spell conjures one of the creatures from the 1st-level list on the accompanying Summon Nature\'s Ally table. You choose which kind of creature to summon, and you can change that choice each time you cast the spell. All the creatures on the table are neutral unless otherwise noted.</p><p/>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 SpellsS');
INSERT INTO spell VALUES (620,'Summon Nature\'s Ally II','summon nature\'s ally II','Conjuration','Summoning',NULL,NULL,'Druid 2, Ranger 2','V, S, DF','1 round','Close (25 ft. + 5 ft./2 levels)',NULL,NULL,'One or more creatures, no two of which can be more than 30 ft. apart','1 round/level (D)','None','No','Calls animal to fight for you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'\n      <p>This spell functions like <i>summon nature\'s ally I</i>,  except that you can summon one 2nd-level creature or 1d3 1st-level creatures of the same kind.</p>\n      <p/>\n    ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'\n      <div topic=\"Summon Nature\'s Ally II\" level=\"5\"><p><h5>Summon Nature\'s Ally II</h5></p><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\"><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td width=\"25%\"/><td>Conjuration (Summoning)<br/></td></tr><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td width=\"25%\"><b>Level:</b><br/></td><td>Druid 2, Ranger 2<br/></td></tr><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td width=\"25%\"><b>Effect:</b><br/></td><td>One or more creatures, no two of which can be more than 30 ft. apart<br/></td></tr></table><p>This spell functions like <i>summon nature\'s ally I</i>,  except that you can summon one 2nd-level creature or 1d3 1st-level creatures of the same kind.</p><p/>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 SpellsS');
INSERT INTO spell VALUES (621,'Summon Nature\'s Ally III','summon nature\'s ally III','Conjuration','Summoning','see text',NULL,'Druid 3, Ranger 3','V, S, DF','1 round','Close (25 ft. + 5 ft./2 levels)',NULL,NULL,'One or more creatures, no two of which can be more than 30 ft. apart','1 round/level (D)','None','No','Calls animal to fight for you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'\n      <p>This spell functions like <i>summon nature\'s ally I</i>,  except that you can summon one 3rd-level creature, 1d3 2nd-level creatures of the same kind, or 1d4+1 1st-level creatures of the same kind.</p>\n      <p>When you use a summoning spell to summon an air, chaotic, earth, evil, fire, good, lawful, or water creature, it is a spell of that type.</p>\n    ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'\n      <div topic=\"Summon Nature\'s Ally III\" level=\"5\"><p><h5>Summon Nature\'s Ally III</h5></p><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\"><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td width=\"25%\"/><td>Conjuration (Summoning) [see text]<br/></td></tr><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td width=\"25%\"><b>Level:</b><br/></td><td>Druid 3, Ranger 3<br/></td></tr><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td width=\"25%\"><b>Effect:</b><br/></td><td>One or more creatures, no two of which can be more than 30 ft. apart<br/></td></tr></table><p>This spell functions like <i>summon nature\'s ally I</i>,  except that you can summon one 3rd-level creature, 1d3 2nd-level creatures of the same kind, or 1d4+1 1st-level creatures of the same kind.</p><p>When you use a summoning spell to summon an air, chaotic, earth, evil, fire, good, lawful, or water creature, it is a spell of that type.</p>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 SpellsS');
INSERT INTO spell VALUES (622,'Summon Nature\'s Ally IV','summon nature\'s ally IV','Conjuration','Summoning','see text',NULL,'Animal 4, Druid 4, Ranger 4','V, S, DF','1 round','Close (25 ft. + 5 ft./2 levels)',NULL,NULL,'One or more creatures, no two of which can be more than 30 ft. apart','1 round/level (D)','None','No','Calls animal to fight for you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'\n      <p>This spell functions like <i>summon nature\'s ally I</i>,  except that you can summon one 4th-level creature, 1d3 3rd-level creatures of the same kind, or 1d4+1 lower-level creatures of the same kind.</p>\n      <p>When you use a summoning spell to summon an air, chaotic, earth, evil, fire, good, lawful, or water creature, it is a spell of that type.</p>\n      <p/>\n    ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'\n      <div topic=\"Summon Nature\'s Ally IV\" level=\"5\"><p><h5>Summon Nature\'s Ally IV</h5></p><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\"><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td width=\"25%\"/><td>Conjuration (Summoning) [see text]<br/></td></tr><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td width=\"25%\"><b>Level:</b><br/></td><td>Animal 4, Druid 4, Ranger 4<br/></td></tr><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td width=\"25%\"><b>Effect:</b><br/></td><td>One or more creatures, no two of which can be more than 30 ft. apart<br/></td></tr></table><p>This spell functions like <i>summon nature\'s ally I</i>,  except that you can summon one 4th-level creature, 1d3 3rd-level creatures of the same kind, or 1d4+1 lower-level creatures of the same kind.</p><p>When you use a summoning spell to summon an air, chaotic, earth, evil, fire, good, lawful, or water creature, it is a spell of that type.</p><p/>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 SpellsS');
INSERT INTO spell VALUES (623,'Summon Nature\'s Ally V','summon nature\'s ally V','Conjuration','Summoning','see text',NULL,'Druid 5','V, S, DF','1 round','Close (25 ft. + 5 ft./2 levels)',NULL,NULL,'One or more creatures, no two of which can be more than 30 ft. apart','1 round/level (D)','None','No','Calls creature to fight.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'\n      <p>This spell functions like <i>summon nature\'s ally I</i>,  except that you can summon one 5th-level creature, 1d3 4th-level creatures of the same kind, or 1d4+1 lower-level creatures of the same kind.</p>\n      <p>When you use a summoning spell to summon an air, chaotic, earth, evil, fire, good, lawful, or water creature, it is a spell of that type.</p>\n      <p/>\n    ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'\n      <div topic=\"Summon Nature\'s Ally V\" level=\"5\"><p><h5>Summon Nature\'s Ally V</h5></p><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\"><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td width=\"25%\"/><td>Conjuration (Summoning) [see text]<br/></td></tr><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td width=\"25%\"><b>Level:</b><br/></td><td>Druid 5<br/></td></tr><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td width=\"25%\"><b>Effect:</b><br/></td><td>One or more creatures, no two of which can be more than 30 ft. apart<br/></td></tr></table><p>This spell functions like <i>summon nature\'s ally I</i>,  except that you can summon one 5th-level creature, 1d3 4th-level creatures of the same kind, or 1d4+1 lower-level creatures of the same kind.</p><p>When you use a summoning spell to summon an air, chaotic, earth, evil, fire, good, lawful, or water creature, it is a spell of that type.</p><p/>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 SpellsS');
INSERT INTO spell VALUES (624,'Summon Nature\'s Ally VI','summon nature\'s ally VI','Conjuration','Summoning','see text',NULL,'Druid 6','V, S, DF','1 round','Close (25 ft. + 5 ft./2 levels)',NULL,NULL,'One or more creatures, no two of which can be more than 30 ft. apart','1 round/level (D)','None','No','Calls creature to fight.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'\n      <p>This spell functions like <i>summon nature\'s ally I</i>,  except that you can summon one 6th-level creature, 1d3 5th-level creatures of the same kind, or 1d4+1 lower-level creatures of the same kind.</p>\n      <p>When you use a summoning spell to summon an air, chaotic, earth, evil, fire, good, lawful, or water creature, it is a spell of that type.</p>\n      <p/>\n    ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'\n      <div topic=\"Summon Nature\'s Ally VI\" level=\"5\"><p><h5>Summon Nature\'s Ally VI</h5></p><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\"><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td width=\"25%\"/><td>Conjuration (Summoning) [see text]<br/></td></tr><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td width=\"25%\"><b>Level:</b><br/></td><td>Druid 6<br/></td></tr><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td width=\"25%\"><b>Effect:</b><br/></td><td>One or more creatures, no two of which can be more than 30 ft. apart<br/></td></tr></table><p>This spell functions like <i>summon nature\'s ally I</i>,  except that you can summon one 6th-level creature, 1d3 5th-level creatures of the same kind, or 1d4+1 lower-level creatures of the same kind.</p><p>When you use a summoning spell to summon an air, chaotic, earth, evil, fire, good, lawful, or water creature, it is a spell of that type.</p><p/>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 SpellsS');
